OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian injured as bus crashes
OL,4,Ainto building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian was injured when a bus
OL,7,Fcrashed into a building in west London
OL,8,Fon Friday evening.
OL,10,FThe H98 service hit the building on
OL,11,FStation Road near Hayes and Harlington
OL,12,Fstation at about 19:30 BST, becoming
OL,13,Fembedded in a wall.
OL,15,FA video circulating on social media
OL,16,Fshows the bus driving on to a
OL,17,Fmini-roundabout, looping around and
OL,18,Fcrashing into the building.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
