OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian injured as bus crashes
OL,4,Ainto building
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt appears to push a car and knock a
OL,7,Fman to the ground, before becoming
OL,8,Flodged in the wall. The London
OL,9,FAmbulance Service said a man was
OL,10,Ftreated at the scene but was not taken
OL,11,Fto hospital.
